OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fmostly dying out this evening although
OL,7,Fa few lingering along the Argyll coast
OL,8,Fovernight. Otherwise becoming dry with
OL,9,Flengthy clear periods. Strong winds
OL,10,Feasing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMainly dry with variable
OL,13,Famounts of cloud and bright spells.
OL,14,FThe odd shower along the Argyll coast
OL,15,Fat first.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,18,Fon Thursday morning before rain
OL,19,Fspreads east in the afternoon and
OL,20,Fevening. Dry with bright spells on
OL,21,FFriday. Rain likely on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
